IMPORT prelude
IMPORT daydate
IMPORT `sg-core`
IMPORT `sg-interests`

-- Tests for sg-interests.l4 (s 7). Expected values are worked out by hand from the subsection named beside each assertion.
-- The fixtures table below is generated; the assertions are written by hand.

§ `Fixtures`

-- Columns of `s 7 interest facts`, in DECLARE order: authority, trust, knows, contract, transfer, option, control, cis unit, bare trustee, lends, security only, office, own shares, prescribed, bodies corporate.
`a person with no interest` MEANS
    `s 7 interest facts` OF FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, EMPTY
`a person with authority to dispose of the shares` MEANS
    `s 7 interest facts` OF TRUE , FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, EMPTY
`a person with a trust interest who knows of it` MEANS
    `s 7 interest facts` OF FALSE, TRUE , TRUE , FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, EMPTY
`a person with a trust interest who does not know of it` MEANS
    `s 7 interest facts` OF FALSE, TRUE , FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, EMPTY
`a person who knows of an interest under a trust but has none` MEANS
    `s 7 interest facts` OF FALSE, FALSE, TRUE , FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, EMPTY
`a person under a contract to purchase` MEANS
    `s 7 interest facts` OF FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, TRUE , FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, EMPTY
`a person with a right to have a share transferred` MEANS
    `s 7 interest facts` OF FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, TRUE , FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, EMPTY
`a person with an option` MEANS
    `s 7 interest facts` OF FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, TRUE , FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, EMPTY
`a person entitled to control the exercise of a right attached to a share` MEANS
    `s 7 interest facts` OF FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, TRUE , FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, EMPTY
`a person with authority, the thing being a unit in a collective investment scheme` MEANS
    `s 7 interest facts` OF TRUE , FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, TRUE , FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, EMPTY
`a person with authority who holds as bare trustee` MEANS
    `s 7 interest facts` OF TRUE , FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, TRUE , FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, EMPTY
`a person with authority who is a lender holding by way of security only` MEANS
    `s 7 interest facts` OF TRUE , FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, TRUE , TRUE , FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, EMPTY
`a person with authority who is a lender but holds outright` MEANS
    `s 7 interest facts` OF TRUE , FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, TRUE , FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, EMPTY
`a person with authority who holds by way of security only but does not lend` MEANS
    `s 7 interest facts` OF TRUE , FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, TRUE , FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, EMPTY
`a person with authority by reason of a prescribed office` MEANS
    `s 7 interest facts` OF TRUE , FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, TRUE , FALSE, FALSE, EMPTY
`a company with authority over its own repurchased shares` MEANS
    `s 7 interest facts` OF TRUE , FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, TRUE , FALSE, EMPTY
`a person with authority and a prescribed interest` MEANS
    `s 7 interest facts` OF TRUE , FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, TRUE , EMPTY

-- A body corporate: its own interest, accustomed to act on the person's directions, the person's controlling interest,
-- then the percentages of voting power the person, the associates, and both together are entitled to exercise or control.
GIVEN own IS A `s 7 interest facts`
      accustomed IS A BOOLEAN
      controlling IS A BOOLEAN
      `the person's percentage` IS A NUMBER
      `the associates' percentage` IS A NUMBER
      `the percentage together` IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A `s 7(4) body corporate`
`a body corporate` MEANS
    `s 7(4) body corporate` OF own, accustomed, controlling, `the person's percentage`, `the associates' percentage`, `the percentage together`

-- A holder with no direct interest of its own, whose only route is through these bodies corporate.
GIVEN bodies IS A LIST OF `s 7(4) body corporate`
GIVETH A `s 7 interest facts`
`a holder whose only route is through` MEANS
    `s 7 interest facts` OF FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, bodies

§ `Section 7(1): which provisions the subsections serve`

#ASSERT `s 7(1) the subsections other than (6A) have effect for the purposes of` `s 7(1) Division 4 of Part 4` EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 7(1) the subsections other than (6A) have effect for the purposes of` `s 7(1) section 163` EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 7(1) the subsections other than (6A) have effect for the purposes of` `s 7(1) section 164` EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 7(1) the subsections other than (6A) have effect for the purposes of` `s 7(1) section 165` EQUALS JUST TRUE
-- For s 244 the text names (6A) alone: not covered for the others.
#ASSERT `s 7(1) the subsections other than (6A) have effect for the purposes of` `s 7(1) section 244` EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `s 7(1) the subsections other than (6A) have effect for the purposes of` `s 7(1) some other provision` EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `s 7(1) subsection (6A) has effect for the purposes of` `s 7(1) Division 4 of Part 4` EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 7(1) subsection (6A) has effect for the purposes of` `s 7(1) section 165` EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 7(1) subsection (6A) has effect for the purposes of` `s 7(1) section 244` EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 7(1) subsection (6A) has effect for the purposes of` `s 7(1) some other provision` EQUALS NOTHING

§ `Section 7(1A), (2) and (6): the direct limbs`

#ASSERT `s 7 the person has an interest in the shares` `s 7(1) Division 4 of Part 4` `a person with authority to dispose of the shares` EQUALS JUST TRUE         -- (1A)
#ASSERT `s 7 the person has an interest in the shares` `s 7(1) Division 4 of Part 4` `a person with a trust interest who knows of it` EQUALS JUST TRUE             -- (2)
#ASSERT `s 7 the person has an interest in the shares` `s 7(1) Division 4 of Part 4` `a person with a trust interest who does not know of it` EQUALS JUST FALSE   -- (2): knowledge is required
#ASSERT `s 7 the person has an interest in the shares` `s 7(1) Division 4 of Part 4` `a person who knows of an interest under a trust but has none` EQUALS JUST FALSE   -- (2): there must be an interest under a trust
#ASSERT `s 7 the person has an interest in the shares` `s 7(1) Division 4 of Part 4` `a person under a contract to purchase` EQUALS JUST TRUE                   -- (6)(a)
#ASSERT `s 7 the person has an interest in the shares` `s 7(1) Division 4 of Part 4` `a person with a right to have a share transferred` EQUALS JUST TRUE         -- (6)(b)
#ASSERT `s 7 the person has an interest in the shares` `s 7(1) Division 4 of Part 4` `a person with an option` EQUALS JUST TRUE                                   -- (6)(c)
#ASSERT `s 7 the person has an interest in the shares` `s 7(1) Division 4 of Part 4` `a person entitled to control the exercise of a right attached to a share` EQUALS JUST TRUE   -- (6)(d)
#ASSERT `s 7 the person has an interest in the shares` `s 7(1) Division 4 of Part 4` `a person with no interest` EQUALS JUST FALSE
-- The same facts for each provision s 7(1) serves.
#ASSERT `s 7 the person has an interest in the shares` `s 7(1) section 163` `a person with authority to dispose of the shares` EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 7 the person has an interest in the shares` `s 7(1) section 164` `a person with authority to dispose of the shares` EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 7 the person has an interest in the shares` `s 7(1) section 165` `a person with authority to dispose of the shares` EQUALS JUST TRUE
-- Not covered: s 244 (only (6A) is named) and any other provision.
#ASSERT `s 7 the person has an interest in the shares` `s 7(1) section 244` `a person with authority to dispose of the shares` EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `s 7 the person has an interest in the shares` `s 7(1) some other provision` `a person with authority to dispose of the shares` EQUALS NOTHING

§ `Section 7(1B), (7), (8), (10): what does not matter`

#ASSERT `s 7(1B) the restraint on the authority matters to whether the person has authority` TRUE EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `s 7(1B) the restraint on the authority matters to whether the person has authority` FALSE EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `s 7(7) the joint holding is a reason to find that the person has no interest` TRUE EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `s 7(7) the joint holding is a reason to find that the person has no interest` FALSE EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `s 7(8) that the interest cannot be related to a particular share matters` TRUE EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `s 7(8) that the interest cannot be related to a particular share matters` FALSE EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `s 7(10) the ground is a reason to disregard the interest` TRUE EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `s 7(10) the ground is a reason to disregard the interest` FALSE EQUALS NOTHING

§ `Section 7(3): collective investment scheme units`

#ASSERT `s 7(3) the thing is a unit that does not constitute an interest in a share` `a person with authority, the thing being a unit in a collective investment scheme` EQUALS TRUE
#ASSERT `s 7(3) the thing is a unit that does not constitute an interest in a share` `a person with authority to dispose of the shares` EQUALS FALSE
-- A unit is not an interest, even where the holder has authority.
#ASSERT `s 7 the person has an interest in the shares` `s 7(1) Division 4 of Part 4` `a person with authority, the thing being a unit in a collective investment scheme` EQUALS JUST FALSE

§ `Section 7(9): interests to be disregarded`

#ASSERT `s 7(9) the interest is to be disregarded` `a person with authority who holds as bare trustee` EQUALS TRUE                              -- (a)
#ASSERT `s 7(9) the interest is to be disregarded` `a person with authority who is a lender holding by way of security only` EQUALS TRUE      -- (b), both limbs
#ASSERT `s 7(9) the interest is to be disregarded` `a person with authority who is a lender but holds outright` EQUALS FALSE                 -- (b) needs the security limb
#ASSERT `s 7(9) the interest is to be disregarded` `a person with authority who holds by way of security only but does not lend` EQUALS FALSE -- (b) needs the lending business
#ASSERT `s 7(9) the interest is to be disregarded` `a person with authority by reason of a prescribed office` EQUALS TRUE                    -- (c)
#ASSERT `s 7(9) the interest is to be disregarded` `a company with authority over its own repurchased shares` EQUALS TRUE                   -- (ca)
#ASSERT `s 7(9) the interest is to be disregarded` `a person with authority and a prescribed interest` EQUALS TRUE                          -- (d)
#ASSERT `s 7(9) the interest is to be disregarded` `a person with authority to dispose of the shares` EQUALS FALSE
-- Each disregard takes the interest out of the answer.
#ASSERT `s 7 the person has an interest in the shares` `s 7(1) Division 4 of Part 4` `a person with authority who holds as bare trustee` EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `s 7 the person has an interest in the shares` `s 7(1) Division 4 of Part 4` `a person with authority who is a lender holding by way of security only` EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `s 7 the person has an interest in the shares` `s 7(1) Division 4 of Part 4` `a person with authority who is a lender but holds outright` EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 7 the person has an interest in the shares` `s 7(1) Division 4 of Part 4` `a person with authority who holds by way of security only but does not lend` EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 7 the person has an interest in the shares` `s 7(1) Division 4 of Part 4` `a person with authority by reason of a prescribed office` EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `s 7 the person has an interest in the shares` `s 7(1) Division 4 of Part 4` `a company with authority over its own repurchased shares` EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `s 7 the person has an interest in the shares` `s 7(1) Division 4 of Part 4` `a person with authority and a prescribed interest` EQUALS JUST FALSE

§ `Section 7(5): associates`

#ASSERT `s 7(5) the firstmentioned person is an associate of the other person` TRUE FALSE FALSE EQUALS JUST TRUE    -- (a) a subsidiary
#ASSERT `s 7(5) the firstmentioned person is an associate of the other person` FALSE TRUE FALSE EQUALS JUST TRUE    -- (b) accustomed to act
#ASSERT `s 7(5) the firstmentioned person is an associate of the other person` FALSE FALSE TRUE EQUALS JUST TRUE    -- (c) a body corporate, or a majority of whose directors are, accustomed
#ASSERT `s 7(5) the firstmentioned person is an associate of the other person` FALSE FALSE FALSE EQUALS JUST FALSE

§ `Section 7(4): through a body corporate that follows the person or that the person controls`

-- (4)(a): the body corporate has an interest and is accustomed to act on the person's directions.
#ASSERT `s 7 the person has an interest in the shares` `s 7(1) Division 4 of Part 4` (`a holder whose only route is through` (LIST (`a body corporate` `a person with authority to dispose of the shares` TRUE FALSE 0 0 0))) EQUALS JUST TRUE
-- (4)(b): a controlling interest in the body corporate.
#ASSERT `s 7 the person has an interest in the shares` `s 7(1) Division 4 of Part 4` (`a holder whose only route is through` (LIST (`a body corporate` `a person with authority to dispose of the shares` FALSE TRUE 0 0 0))) EQUALS JUST TRUE
-- Neither limb, and no voting power: no deemed interest.
#ASSERT `s 7 the person has an interest in the shares` `s 7(1) Division 4 of Part 4` (`a holder whose only route is through` (LIST (`a body corporate` `a person with authority to dispose of the shares` FALSE FALSE 0 0 0))) EQUALS JUST FALSE
-- A body corporate with no interest has none to pass on, even if it follows the person.
#ASSERT `s 7 the person has an interest in the shares` `s 7(1) Division 4 of Part 4` (`a holder whose only route is through` (LIST (`a body corporate` `a person with no interest` TRUE TRUE 100 100 100))) EQUALS JUST FALSE
-- A body corporate whose own interest is disregarded (a bare trustee) passes nothing up (a reading, NOTES.md).
#ASSERT `s 7 the person has an interest in the shares` `s 7(1) Division 4 of Part 4` (`a holder whose only route is through` (LIST (`a body corporate` `a person with authority who holds as bare trustee` TRUE TRUE 100 100 100))) EQUALS JUST FALSE
-- Several bodies corporate: one route is enough.
#ASSERT `s 7 the person has an interest in the shares` `s 7(1) Division 4 of Part 4` (`a holder whose only route is through` (LIST (`a body corporate` `a person with no interest` TRUE TRUE 0 0 0), (`a body corporate` `a person with authority to dispose of the shares` TRUE FALSE 0 0 0))) EQUALS JUST TRUE

§ `Section 7(4A): not less than 20% of the voting power`

-- The person alone: exactly 20 is in, 19.9 is out.
#ASSERT `s 7 the person has an interest in the shares` `s 7(1) Division 4 of Part 4` (`a holder whose only route is through` (LIST (`a body corporate` `a person with authority to dispose of the shares` FALSE FALSE 20 0 0))) EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 7 the person has an interest in the shares` `s 7(1) Division 4 of Part 4` (`a holder whose only route is through` (LIST (`a body corporate` `a person with authority to dispose of the shares` FALSE FALSE 19.9 0 0))) EQUALS JUST FALSE
-- The associates alone (limb (b)).
#ASSERT `s 7 the person has an interest in the shares` `s 7(1) Division 4 of Part 4` (`a holder whose only route is through` (LIST (`a body corporate` `a person with authority to dispose of the shares` FALSE FALSE 0 20 0))) EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 7 the person has an interest in the shares` `s 7(1) Division 4 of Part 4` (`a holder whose only route is through` (LIST (`a body corporate` `a person with authority to dispose of the shares` FALSE FALSE 0 19.9 0))) EQUALS JUST FALSE
-- The person and the associates together (limb (c)): 10 and 10 is 20.
#ASSERT `s 7 the person has an interest in the shares` `s 7(1) Division 4 of Part 4` (`a holder whose only route is through` (LIST (`a body corporate` `a person with authority to dispose of the shares` FALSE FALSE 10 10 20))) EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 7 the person has an interest in the shares` `s 7(1) Division 4 of Part 4` (`a holder whose only route is through` (LIST (`a body corporate` `a person with authority to dispose of the shares` FALSE FALSE 10 9.9 19.9))) EQUALS JUST FALSE

§ `Chains: s 7(4) carries a deemed interest up; s 7(4A) is applied "apart from this subsection"`

`a middle holder that follows through a body corporate with authority` MEANS
    `a holder whose only route is through` (LIST (`a body corporate` `a person with authority to dispose of the shares` TRUE FALSE 0 0 0))
-- Two levels of (4): the outer body corporate follows the person, the middle holds through an inner body corporate that follows it.
#ASSERT `s 7 the person has an interest in the shares` `s 7(1) Division 4 of Part 4` (`a holder whose only route is through` (LIST (`a body corporate` `a middle holder that follows through a body corporate with authority` TRUE FALSE 0 0 0))) EQUALS JUST TRUE
-- The middle holder's interest is a (4A) interest only: it holds 20% of an inner body corporate that has authority.
`a middle holder with a 20% route only` MEANS
    `a holder whose only route is through` (LIST (`a body corporate` `a person with authority to dispose of the shares` FALSE FALSE 20 0 0))
-- (4) takes the middle holder's interest "by the provisions of this section", (4A) included: so following it is enough.
#ASSERT `s 7 the person has an interest in the shares` `s 7(1) Division 4 of Part 4` (`a holder whose only route is through` (LIST (`a body corporate` `a middle holder with a 20% route only` TRUE FALSE 0 0 0))) EQUALS JUST TRUE
-- (4A) does not: it takes the body corporate's interest "apart from this subsection", so 20% of a body corporate whose interest is itself a (4A) interest gives nothing.
#ASSERT `s 7 the person has an interest in the shares` `s 7(1) Division 4 of Part 4` (`a holder whose only route is through` (LIST (`a body corporate` `a middle holder with a 20% route only` FALSE FALSE 20 0 0))) EQUALS JUST FALSE
-- The interest apart from (4A) is the narrower question.
#ASSERT `s 7 the person has an interest apart from subsection (4A)` (`a holder whose only route is through` (LIST (`a body corporate` `a person with authority to dispose of the shares` FALSE FALSE 20 0 0))) EQUALS FALSE
#ASSERT `s 7 the person has an interest` (`a holder whose only route is through` (LIST (`a body corporate` `a person with authority to dispose of the shares` FALSE FALSE 20 0 0))) EQUALS TRUE

§ `Section 7(6A): book-entry securities`

#ASSERT `s 7(6A) the book-entry security is treated as an interest in a share` `s 7(1) section 163` TRUE EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 7(6A) the book-entry security is treated as an interest in a share` `s 7(1) Division 4 of Part 4` TRUE EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 7(6A) the book-entry security is treated as an interest in a share` `s 7(1) section 244` TRUE EQUALS JUST TRUE
-- Not covered: another provision, or a thing that is not a book-entry security.
#ASSERT `s 7(6A) the book-entry security is treated as an interest in a share` `s 7(1) some other provision` TRUE EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `s 7(6A) the book-entry security is treated as an interest in a share` `s 7(1) section 164` FALSE EQUALS NOTHING
